  "anchor": "Plan v28 Lane A — realistic net-margin caps per sector. The estimateNetProfit() pipeline can produce inflated net margins when US-anchored gross margins are applied to non-US revenue minus low local payroll. These caps clamp the output to defensible ranges. Any margin above the hard cap gets clamped + flagged; any margin above the investigate threshold gets logged for review.",
